name issue_430_av_outage_4s
describe audio+video call, 4 s outage at 15 s on both paths: video returns about 6.2 s after the last frame, as libwebrtc (parity, #430)
# Tester repro from #430 (commit 9ad10c6): video returns 2.3 s after link-up, about 6.2 s after the last frame. libwebrtc does the same
# (#433's compare-webrtc, seeds 1-10, @ 0d86dcc):
#   metric                ours mean (min-max)       libwebrtc mean (min-max)
#   video.pause_total_ms  6225 (6152-6727)          6183 (6157-6211)
#   video.render_fps      25.26 (25.18-25.28)       25.24 (25.20-25.28)
# Both stacks wait for the receiver's 3 s decode timeout (video_receive_stream2.cc kMaxWaitForFrame, OnDecodableFrameTimeout): the first keyframe request falls in the outage and is lost, the next one is sent 3 s later. The expect lines hold the call at libwebrtc's worst seed plus about 10 %.
seed 1
duration 40s
at 0s capacity=1500kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
at 15s down
at 19s up
reverse at 0s delay=30ms
reverse at 15s down
reverse at 19s up
expect video.pause_total_ms < 6850
expect video.render_fps > 22.7
